Z||000001||Sage||10-15-2001||05:01 PM||||gt boy;<P>I don't have one of Rodney's shifters, but I have bought other products from him.  I would guess that anything you get from Rodney, will be top notch.  It will work as expected, it will fit like it's supposed to, and it will come with instructions!  In general, I would say that if it isn't what it's supposed to be, Rodney won't carry it.<P>JMO<P><P>------------------<BR>Have a good one!||||reg||1
Z||000002||artherd||10-15-2001||05:15 PM||||I've got one, he makes a great variety.<P>The one I have is actually his 'euro shifter arm' it's like the straight polished arm, but a bit thinner (10mm vs 15mm I belive? I know mine is 10mm at least)<P>Love the look and shifting action, close to a proper Ferrari as I can get  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Best!<BR>Ben<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
Z||000003||Monkeyman||10-15-2001||06:26 PM||||I have one of his super short Competition shifters.  I absolutely love it!  I've done other business with Rodney, too.  He stands behind everything he sells.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Rick 88||10-15-2001||06:38 PM||||I have Rodneys Competition shifter. It allowed me to use my stock leather shift knob. He also includes a nice leather boot with better attachment than the factory piece. The shifter sticks straight up. This is much better for me since I have long arms.<BR>The shift action is very positive and quick.<P>Rick 88||||reg||14
Z||000005||JD86GT350||10-15-2001||06:40 PM||||I've got his competition short throw shifter, and its really great, service was amazingly speedy.||||reg||1
Z||000006||tgowens||10-15-2001||06:55 PM||||I have two of his Competition short shifters. I think you will like them for less arm movement and a much nicer appearance. I highly recommend them!||||reg||1
Z||000007||88formula||10-15-2001||07:49 PM||||Everything I have ever bought from Rodney has been WAY ABOVE TOP NOTCH QUALITY. You can’t go wrong with Rodney’s stuff. He’s the best! <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
